GET /api/v1/sites/{site_id}/database/branch/{branch_id}
Returns the database branch connection string for a specific branch.
Optional: role (query) — The database role to use for the connection string. Defaults to netlifydb_owner if not specified.

GET /api/v1/sites/{site_id}/database/migrations/{name}
Returns the contents of a named migration for the specified branch.
Optional: branch (query) — The branch ID to look up the migration on. Defaults to the currently published deploy's branch.

POST /api/v1/sites/{site_id}/database/migrations/{deploy_id}
Runs database migrations for the specified deploy. Finds the deploy and determines the appropriate branch.
Optional: body (body)
